function totalDeltaB() external view returns (int256 deltaB) {
    deltaB = LibWellMinting.check(C.BEAN_ETH_WELL);
}

findings.recommendation:
Compute totalDeltaB the same way the protocol mints: iterate LibWhitelistedTokens.getWhitelistedWellLpTokens() and accumulate LibWellMinting.check(tokens[i]) (the view-safe twin of stepOracle's capture), e.g.

function totalDeltaB() external view returns (int256 deltaB) {
    address[] memory tokens = LibWhitelistedTokens.getWhitelistedWellLpTokens();
    for (uint256 i; i < tokens.length; i++) {
        deltaB = deltaB + LibWellMinting.check(tokens[i]);
    }
}

Alternatively rename/redocument the getter to make clear it reports a single well (e.g. beanEthDeltaB()).
